formation about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Types of Stores", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Stores are places you buy things. There are many different types of stores. Different countries have different types of stores.<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">In Europe, many stores are often <span class = \"italic\">specialized</span> - they sell a small number of things:</span><br/><br/>bakery - bread<br/>pastry shop - pastries<br/>pharmacy (drugstore) - medication<br/>perfumery - perfume<br/>butcher shop - meat<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">In North America, stores are more <span class = \"italic\">generalized</span> - they sell many things:</span><br/><br/>grocery store - fruits, vegetables, meat, bread, etc.<br/>supermarket - a large grocery store<br/>convenience store (corner store) - milk, bread, candy, newspapers, etc. <br/>hardware store - nails, tools, cleaning supplies, etc.<br/>department store - clothing, furniture, shoes, perfume, etc.<br/>outlet stores - large stores that get items directly from the company that makes them", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "jeans", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very popular pants made of denim", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you like these jeans?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you shop for clothes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "t-shirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a shirt shaped like a T, with short sleeves", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to try on this T-shirt with those jeans.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "casual wear", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing for sports or recreation, not for work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This store has a good casual wear department.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "boots", "type": "name"}, {"content": "protection for the feet for outdoor use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Do you like these boots?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "leather", "type": "name"}, {"content": "material originally from animals, used to make boots and coats", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These boots are made of leather.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sweatshirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing for the upper body, often for sports", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I'm going to try on this sweatshirt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hoodie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sweatshirt with a part to cover the head", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Try this hoodie. It has a hood.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "outlet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a store that sells goods directly from the manufacturer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going shopping at the new outlet store this afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mall", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a building with many stores", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I love the new mall!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "store", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place you buy things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many stores in this mall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, talk about shopping.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of 3 good things. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">new clothes</span>, <span class=\"italic\">fun</span>.<br/> <ul><li> ______________________________</li> <li> ______________________________</li> <li> ______________________________</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of 3 bad things. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">noisy</span>, <span class=\"italic\">crowded</span>. <br/><ul><li> ______________________________</li> <li> ______________________________</li> <li> ______________________________</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Compare your answers with a partner's answers.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about shopping.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 3 good things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 3 bad things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}